# Claims desk dual surface

Roz Claims Trees and the standalone workshop HTML
(`Structured Narrative/output/cross_company/reports/claims_desk.html`)
are the same desk.

- Change filters, rates, buckets, edges, captions, or the tree
  list in both surfaces unless the user says they may differ.
- Shared helpers live in
  `services/earnings_monitor/dashboard/claims_trees.py`.
- After a desk change, rebuild the HTML with
  `python scripts/_desk_trees_workshop_html.py`.
- Do not give the workshop its own scoring path.
